{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_172","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c 'p=\"$TMPDIR/ordered/formal/riscv-formal/cores/bench-w3nIVDC0n/checks\"; ls \"$p\"/*/PASS 2>/dev/null | wc -l; ls \"$p\"/*/FAIL 2>/dev/null | wc -l; date -u; cat cores/bench/implementation_notes.md | tail -12; git diff --check'","aggregated_output":"26\n0\nSun Nov 22 00:57:39 UTC 2026\n- A posted store can hold an ordered branch with a misaligned target. On the wait edge the core records an untaken outcome so that a legal fall-through can pass the pending store. A taken fault waits for the store to drain and continues at PC+4.\n- Collection preselects the ALU's second operand and uses its existing direct-target adder for AUIPC. BEQ and BNE exploit the zeroed saved operands on adjacent bypasses to compare both halves in EX. The registered fetch recovery state masks stale replay responses, and an accepted FENCE.I invalidates the replay groups on the following edge.\n\n## Local checks\n\nAll 120 cocotb cases passed across six runners. The directed tests cover both sides of bits 31 and 16, equal upper halves, equality, negative immediates, adjacent consumers, both directions of replay training, wrong-path store, divide and FENCE.I, and misaligned targets behind a posted store.\n\nVerilator lint passed with `-Wall`. Co-simulation passed for five ELFs. With both stall generators, CoreMark ran ten iterations between marker cycles 12,421 and 3,076,335, a span of 3,063,914 cycles. All five CRCs matched and UART reported “Correct operation validated.”\n\nGowin placement options 0, 1 and 2 reached 96.123, 98.476 and 98.476 MHz, respectively. The median gives 321.41 CoreMark iterations per second and falls below the 102.389 MHz qualifying threshold. The placement-0 limit is ALU forwarding. Placement 1 is limited by the data-memory return through MEM to the collected second ALU operand.\n\nThe first full formal rerun after the branch-commit fix passed all 53 checks. A fresh run of the same suite against the final timing-tuned RTL is in progress.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
