.9% gain over 12.12 iterations/s.\\n\", 'expected_impact': {'fitness_delta_pct': 27, 'confidence': 'high'}, 'changes': [{'file': 'rtl/alu.sv', 'description': \"Share a bank of 36-bit shift/add multiples of the divisor magnitude.\\nIn step i (1 through 8), the dividend prefix bounds the trial width\\nto W = 4*i bits. Subtract each multiple's low W bits with a borrow\\nbit and independently check its upper bits for zero. Combine those\\ntests into fit flags. Use adjacent flags to one-hot select the\\nresidual, including the unmodified trial for digit zero. Encode\\neach quotient nibble from the fit flags\n…[7786 of 10858 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d6910de42b083f2c]…\nnt of its\\ncounter snapshot, and write enable on that same advance.\\nPreserve misalignment traps, forwarded branch operands and JAL/JALR link data.\\n'}, {'file': 'rtl/core.sv', 'description': 'Route EX training to IF and use the correction signal for the existing PC redirect and younger-instruction flush controls.'}, {'file': 'test/test_pipeline.py', 'description': 'Exercise a warming backward loop and its exit, forward taken branches,\\nJAL, JALR and misaligned targets. Check the RVFI PC sequence and absence\\nof wrong-path stores with an imem stall at recovery and an older dmem\\noperation holding the resolving branch in EX.\\n'}]}\nfmax_mhz 5.488\ncycles 4203476\ncritical_path {'from': 'cpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_0_s0', 'to': 'dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s', 'slack_ns': -182.391, 'arrival_ns': 192.685, 'logic_cells': 160, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_fwd', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu', 'cpu/u_ex']}\nimplementation_notes \ntotal 16\ndrwxrwx---+ 2 nobody nogroup 4096 Nov 21 14:32 .\ndrwxrwx---+ 3 nobody nogroup 4096 Nov 21 14:32 ..\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
