dence: medium\nchanges:\n  - file: rtl/reg_file.sv\n    description: Infer distributed storage with per-register written bits and support raw reads while preserving standalone write-through behavior.\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: Register producer matches, fallback selects and one shared WB data snapshot on ID advance. Connect qualified operand masks to EX.\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: Select each operand with a one-hot masked OR. Use the youngest-source bit for the existing load comparison and pointer-load bypasses.\nYAML\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
