8, 12], f\"unexpected retirement PC sequence: {pcs}\"\n540:    \"\"\"JAL x1, +8; verify the wrong-path slot does not retire and x1=PC+4.\"\"\"\n543:        ADDI(2, 0, 99),        # PC=4 — wrong-path; must not retire\n549:    assert pcs == [0, 8, 12], f\"unexpected retirement PC sequence: {pcs}\"\n559:    \"\"\"ADDI x5,x0,12; JALR x1,x5,0; verify wrong-path slot doesn't retire.\"\"\"\n569:    assert pcs == [0, 4, 12, 16], f\"unexpected retirement PC sequence: {pcs}\"\n592:    \"\"\"0xFFFFFFFF retires with rvfi_trap=1 and no rd write.\n615:    \"\"\"ECALL retires with rvfi_trap=1 (project-specific: only EBREAK is legal).\"\"\"\n627:    \"\"\"EBREAK retires with rvfi_trap=0 — this is the project-specific halt marker.\"\"\"\n1085:            \"hazard_unit.sv\", \"forward_unit.sv\",\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
