igit\\nand the residual to carry into the next step. Eight serial digit decisions\\nshorten the EX path while retaining single-cycle execution and forwarding.\\nA scratch prototype reached 6.324, 6.907 and 6.907 MHz on Gowin placement\\noptions 0, 1 and 2. It passed 13,588 arithmetic comparisons and validated\\nall CoreMark CRCs in the baseline's 4,491,485 bracketed cycles. The median\\nclock gives 15.38 iterations/s, a 26.9% gain over 12.12 iterations/s.\\n\", 'expected_impact': {'fitness_delta_pct': 27, 'confidence\n…[30734 of 33806 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:a1db97d56fd29abc]…\nm a loop, stall imem on a BTB hit and an index collision, and\\ncheck both fetch acceptance and RVFI PC pairs. Alternate targets at\\none JALR and place a store on the wrong path. Exercise recovery with\\nan older stalled load, a misaligned target, and replacement code\\nafter FENCE.I. Check store strobes, link values and retirement order.\\n'}]}, 'expected_impact': {'fitness_delta_pct': 9, 'confidence': 'medium'}, 'changes': [{'file': 'rtl/if_stage.sv', 'description': \"Index by PC[7:2]. Match a valid entry's PC[19:8] tag and require\\nPC[31:20] to be zero. Store the aligned target's bits [19:2],\\nthe original 32-bit instruction and a two-bit counter in parallel\\narrays with one write port. Reset the 64 valid bits. On a hit,\\nselect external data whenever imem is ready and use the saved word\\nwhen imem stalls. Default the next PC to PC+4. Predict the stored\\ntarget on a hit when the counter MSB is set and the selected word\\nis a legal control transfer. Check the raw opcode and funct3 on an\\nexternal response. Save\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
