\": \"Replace the two 16-word sequences at each of the 64 BTB indices with a synchronous,\\n2,048-entry next-fetch table indexed by instruction PC. Each tagged word\\ncan serve an imem wait irrespective of the preceding branch or the length\\nof the straight-line run. A control word also predicts its next PC using\\nits last resolved target and two-bit direction counter.\\n\\nRegister the EX correction and full targ\n…[27645 of 30717 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:192ea670ea0ae0e8]…\n_coremark\": 3e-06,\n \"cycles\": 3216888,\n \"iterations\": 10,\n \"lut4\": 3765,\n \"ff\": 922,\n \"seeds\": [\n  48.843,\n  51.373,\n  51.373\n ],\n \"perturbations\": [\n  [\n   0,\n   48.843,\n   30\n  ],\n  [\n   1,\n   51.373,\n   30\n  ],\n  [\n   2,\n   51.373,\n   30\n  ]\n ],\n \"lutram\": 8,\n \"bsram\": 23,\n \"dsp\": 2,\n \"critical_path\": {\n  \"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/quotient_q_29_s1\",\n  \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/remainder_q_4_s0\",\n  \"slack_ns\": -15.474,\n  \"arrival_ns\": 25.768,\n  \"logic_cells\": 144,\n  \"modules\": [\n   \"clock_ibuf\",\n   \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\"\n  ]\n },\n \"logic_levels\": 30,\n \"formal_passed\": true,\n \"cosim_passed\": true,\n \"error\": null,\n \"implementation_notes\": \"\",\n \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-21T16:22:28.688493Z\",\n \"slot\": 2,\n \"round_id\": 6,\n \"lesson\": \"- 2026-11-21 hyp-20261121-003-r6s2 (regression, +5.60%): PC-indexed replay with parallel reads of PC+4 and the predicted target saved 182,462 cycles over ten CoreMark iterations, but target RAM feedback through `u_hazard` was only 0.007 ns shorter than the EX divider path in the median placement.\"\n}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
