{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_43","type":"agent_message","text":"The proposed 32-entry branch predictor reached **13.05 CoreMark iterations/s** in a temporary RTL prototype, **7.64% above the 12.12 baseline** and above the 4.6% acceptance threshold.\n\nThe prototype completed ten iterations in 4,203,476 marker cycles, matched all five expected CRCs, and achieved a median Gowin Fmax of 5.484 MHz across three placements. Formal verification remains for the implementation phase.\n\nThe [hypothesis YAML](/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6_2-astra_xhigh-v2-rep4/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261121-003-r1s2-hypgen/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261121-003-r1s2.yaml) passed schema validation."}}
