{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"agent_message","text":"The champion took 3,511,720 cycles with both buses stalled and 3,379,672 with only data-bus stalls. At the same clock speed, closing that fetch gap would gain about 3.9%, short of the 4.6% cutoff. I’ve written a hypothesis that also reduces branch-target conflicts, and I’ll test it in a scratch copy."}}
