{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_40","type":"agent_message","text":"The PC-stride prototype saved 39,881 cycles, but its address check put the data-memory response on the fetch-stall path and lowered Fmax. I’m testing whether the same load-address prediction is more effective when it starts an early bus read and the core verifies the base register in parallel."}}
